<title>EGYPT: Egyptian Iron and Steel Q3 96/7 results. [CORRECTED 15:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>Egyptian Iron and Steel Q3 96/7 results. [CORRECTED 15:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the third quarter of the 1996/7 financial year which ended on June 30.  (All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available).</p>
<p>			  July 1, 1996-March 31, 1997</p>
<p>Net sales		     1,168,697,473</p>
<p>Production costs	    1,250,747,076</p>
<p>Net loss before tax	    82,049,603</p>
<p>(Corrects above from &quot;net profit before tax&quot;).</p>
<p>Full company name is Egyptian Iron and Steel.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
